{
  "name": "Inbox Cleanup - Gmail",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Limpieza y organizacion de bandeja\n**Objetivo:** ordenar el inbox automaticamente.\n- Copias Zendesk / fallos Apps Script / avisos Zoom -> **Papelera** (recuperable 30 dias)\n- Colaboracion -> se queda en inbox + estrella + label\n- Informativos -> label y fuera del inbox\n**Trigger:** Gmail Trigger cada 5 min. Prueba: boton 'Execute workflow' con un correo en inbox.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credenciales a configurar\n1. Gmail OAuth2 (PLACEHOLDER_GMAIL)\n2. Slack (PLACEHOLDER_SLACK) para #ops-alerts\n\n## IDs a reemplazar\n- PLACEHOLDER_LABEL_COLAB\n- PLACEHOLDER_LABEL_INFO\n(crea las labels en Gmail y copia sus IDs; ver 'How to use')",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 3
      },
      "name": "Note - Credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Edita el objeto RULES arriba del codigo para agregar remitentes. Todo lo que no coincida se deja intacto (nunca se borra por defecto).",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 110,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Note - Classifier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        -30
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {
          "labelIds": [
            "INBOX"
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Get New Inbox Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_GMAIL",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Ejemplo de salida: {id, threadId, From:'support@getontop.com', Subject:'[Ontop] Recall SWIFT...', labelIds:['INBOX','UNREAD']}"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ===== REGLAS EDITABLES =====\nconst RULES = {\n  trashSenders:   ['support@getontop.com'],                       // copias de tickets Zendesk\n  trashScript:    { sender: 'noreply-apps-scripts-notifications@google.com', subject: /sync zendesk users/i },\n  trashZoom:      { sender: 'no-reply@zoom.us', subject: /(has joined your meeting|se ha unido a tu reuni)/i },\n  collabSenders:  ['drive-shares-dm-noreply@google.com', 'comments-noreply@docs.google.com', 'calendar-notification@google.com'],\n  infoSenders:    ['notifications@mail.granola.ai', 'events@send.zapier.com'],\n};\n// =============================\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const from = String(item.json.From || '').toLowerCase();\n  const subject = String(item.json.Subject || '');\n  const has = (list) => list.some(s => from.includes(s));\n  let category = 'none', reason = 'Sin regla: se deja en la bandeja';\n\n  if (has(RULES.trashSenders)) { category = 'trash'; reason = 'Copia de ticket Zendesk'; }\n  else if (from.includes(RULES.trashScript.sender) && RULES.trashScript.subject.test(subject)) { category = 'trash'; reason = 'Fallo Apps Script Sync Zendesk Users'; }\n  else if (from.includes(RULES.trashZoom.sender) && RULES.trashZoom.subject.test(subject)) { category = 'trash'; reason = 'Aviso Zoom: alguien se unio'; }\n  else if (has(RULES.collabSenders)) { category = 'collab'; reason = 'Colaboracion'; }\n  else if (has(RULES.infoSenders)) { category = 'info'; reason = 'Informativo / baja prioridad'; }\n\n  out.push({ json: { ...item.json, category, reason } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "name": "Transform Classify Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "trash",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "trash",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Trash"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "collab",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "collab",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Collab"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "info",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "info",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Info"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Filter Route By Category",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        160
